{
  "_readme": [
    "Single source of truth for Groupon campaigns, shared by the /groupon page,",
    "the redemption function and scripts/groupon-vouchers.mjs.",
    "",
    "Each option's `key` is stable and appears in that campaign's redemption link",
    "(/groupon?deal=<key>), so a customer following their own voucher arrives with",
    "the right deal already selected. Never change or reuse a key once a campaign",
    "is live — vouchers in the wild carry it.",
    "",
    "valuePence is the Groupon ORIGINAL VALUE: what the voucher is worth as credit",
    "here, matching the site price by design. dealPence is what the customer paid",
    "Groupon, recorded for reporting only.",
    "",
    "`match` identifies the option within a Groupon CSV export, case-insensitively."
  ],
